WEBVTT

01:41.360 --> 01:42.240
Thank you.

01:44.720 --> 01:46.440
I just finished your Soul Detective.

01:46.520 --> 01:48.360
It was really great.

01:50.000 --> 01:51.640
The detective's character is amazing.

01:51.720 --> 01:54.640
No wonder readers consider it a classic.

01:54.720 --> 01:55.840
Xiaoya, have you read it?

01:57.360 --> 01:59.240
Lin Qiaqia's comics
are for younger audiences.

01:59.320 --> 02:00.280
Not my thing.

02:03.600 --> 02:04.800
What a big diamond ring.

02:05.720 --> 02:06.880
Did your boyfriend propose?

02:06.960 --> 02:08.800
He proposed last week.

02:08.880 --> 02:11.160
It's so big. It must be two carats, right?

02:11.240 --> 02:12.600
3.3 carats. My birthday.

02:13.920 --> 02:15.240
- 3.3 carats?
- 3.3 carats?

02:15.320 --> 02:17.080
Is your boyfriend that rich?

02:18.120 --> 02:19.760
- What does he do?
- He works in finance.

02:19.840 --> 02:21.000
Finance?

02:21.080 --> 02:23.280
- Finance.
- People in finance must be rich.

02:23.360 --> 02:25.200
- Yeah.
- Lin Qiaqia.

02:25.280 --> 02:26.400
Aren't you getting old too?

02:27.360 --> 02:30.000
I became famous earlier than you,
but I'm actually younger.

02:31.120 --> 02:32.400
I'm about to get married.

02:32.480 --> 02:34.160
When are you going to find a 3D boyfriend?

02:34.760 --> 02:36.920
Stop fantasizing about 2D men.

02:37.000 --> 02:39.920
When you're young, it's cute and naive.

02:40.000 --> 02:41.320
But as you get older,

02:43.440 --> 02:44.360
it's a bit…

02:54.040 --> 02:54.920
No way.

02:55.520 --> 02:57.320
Is this your boyfriend?

02:59.200 --> 03:01.040
He's so handsome.

03:01.120 --> 03:04.080
He's not as handsome
as Lin Qiaqia's imagined 2D boyfriend.

03:04.680 --> 03:06.000
But at least he's real.

03:06.080 --> 03:07.880
Even if we create comics,

03:08.480 --> 03:11.080
creation and life are different.

03:11.160 --> 03:12.920
If you try to treat life like a comic,

03:13.000 --> 03:15.160
it gets a bit unrealistic.

03:18.240 --> 03:19.520
The detective…

03:39.280 --> 03:40.640
That's…

03:40.720 --> 03:42.040
Soul Detective.

03:42.120 --> 03:44.640
Didn't you say my comics
were for younger audiences?

03:44.720 --> 03:46.040
You've never read my comics, right?

03:46.120 --> 03:47.840
Is this the time to talk about that?

03:47.920 --> 03:51.480
The detective.
Wow, the detective is in front of me.

04:08.400 --> 04:11.120
Hello, everyone. I'm Quan Shengtang.
I'm Lin…

04:14.320 --> 04:15.800
I'm Qiaqia's childhood friend.

04:15.880 --> 04:17.480
We grew up together.

04:17.560 --> 04:20.519
Qiaqia. No wonder
your comics are so touching.

04:20.600 --> 04:21.839
You have a real-life prototype.

04:26.160 --> 04:27.400
Thank you.

04:50.960 --> 04:51.960
Gu Yu.

04:52.640 --> 04:53.760
What are you doing?

05:03.760 --> 05:05.840
The editor arranged
a gathering for the authors.

05:05.920 --> 05:06.800
I have an enemy

05:06.880 --> 05:09.280
who tries to cause trouble
every time we meet.

05:09.360 --> 05:10.720
I heard she's engaged.

05:11.320 --> 05:13.000
This time,
she'll definitely try to mock me.

05:13.520 --> 05:14.440
Hello.

05:15.520 --> 05:16.600
I'm Lin Yuan's admirer.

05:17.720 --> 05:19.880
Earlier, I was a bit jealous
and got too emotional.

05:20.680 --> 05:21.800
Sorry for making a scene.

05:23.520 --> 05:25.200
- It's okay.
- It's okay.

05:25.280 --> 05:27.080
What are you talking about?

05:28.600 --> 05:30.320
She's always rejected my pursuit.

05:30.400 --> 05:33.200
Oh, I forgot to introduce myself.
I'm Gu Yu.

05:36.560 --> 05:38.520
The co-founder and marketing director

05:38.600 --> 05:40.600
of Thousand Birds Collection.

05:41.280 --> 05:42.920
Do you mind if I join you?

05:43.640 --> 05:45.080
- Please sit.
- No problem.

05:45.160 --> 05:46.000
Come and sit with us.

05:48.960 --> 05:49.960
Give me that.

05:55.600 --> 05:56.720
The tea's cold. I'll get you a new cup.

05:56.800 --> 05:58.840
Oh, I've used TBC's products.

05:58.920 --> 06:00.360
Tell Lin Yuan what you like.

06:00.440 --> 06:01.880
I'll send you our latest products.

06:01.960 --> 06:03.280
Quan Shengtang.

06:20.080 --> 06:21.200
Can we talk for a moment?

06:32.840 --> 06:34.280
Why Quan Shengtang?

06:39.760 --> 06:40.760
Don't get us wrong.

06:41.680 --> 06:44.240
Earlier, I was acting with Lin Yuan.

06:44.320 --> 06:45.880
Fang Jin knows about this.

06:46.480 --> 06:47.560
I didn't think that way.

06:48.880 --> 06:50.640
Even if I don't know you,

06:50.720 --> 06:52.400
I know Su Chengcheng and Lin Yuan.

06:53.040 --> 06:54.520
They both value friendship.

06:55.040 --> 06:56.200
They wouldn't hurt their friends.

06:58.000 --> 07:00.000
Good for you. You have good judgment.

07:05.360 --> 07:08.040
You know Su Chengcheng?

07:09.560 --> 07:10.680
Yeah.

07:10.760 --> 07:12.200
Why do you ask?

07:13.880 --> 07:15.360
So, do you have a special relationship

07:16.840 --> 07:19.240
with Su Chengcheng?

07:21.440 --> 07:24.280
Not really.

07:24.360 --> 07:26.000
We're just normal friends.

07:29.920 --> 07:31.920
Since everything's cleared up,

07:32.000 --> 07:33.040
I'll be leaving now.

07:33.880 --> 07:34.720
Wait.

07:36.840 --> 07:38.000
I need to clarify something.

07:38.080 --> 07:39.600
Do you have time?

07:39.680 --> 07:41.240
I'd like to invite you and Su Chengcheng

07:41.320 --> 07:42.560
to have a coffee.

07:46.040 --> 07:48.160
- Are you calling Su Chengcheng?
- Yes.

07:55.600 --> 07:56.760
Aren't you going to answer the phone?

07:58.200 --> 07:59.120
Oh, right.

08:05.800 --> 08:07.600
TANG QI

08:16.040 --> 08:16.880
Is it Fang Jin?

08:19.120 --> 08:19.960
Yeah.

08:20.800 --> 08:22.040
You're so smart.

08:22.960 --> 08:24.520
It's Fang Jin.

08:35.760 --> 08:36.600
Darling.

08:37.640 --> 08:38.480
What's wrong?

08:43.200 --> 08:44.080
Don't worry.

08:44.680 --> 08:45.680
It's going well with Lin Yuan.

08:50.240 --> 08:52.240
I'm with Dr. Tang now.

08:55.360 --> 08:56.200
I miss you too.

08:58.000 --> 09:00.280
OK, I'll be back soon.

09:01.880 --> 09:02.960
Wait for me.

09:19.040 --> 09:20.000
I'll never see you again.

09:33.160 --> 09:34.360
Su Chengcheng didn't answer the phone.

09:36.120 --> 09:37.960
I guess she's busy.

09:40.880 --> 09:42.120
Let's reschedule next time.

09:42.880 --> 09:43.840
Goodbye.

09:48.920 --> 09:50.840
Tang Qi still likes Fang Jin.

10:03.520 --> 10:05.120
What are you doing?

10:05.640 --> 10:07.760
Acting so close to me
in front of my friends.

10:07.840 --> 10:09.320
What if they misunderstand?

10:10.040 --> 10:11.320
Is it okay for your friends
to misunderstand

10:11.400 --> 10:12.240
you and Quan Shengtang then?

10:12.320 --> 10:14.000
Of course.

10:14.080 --> 10:15.800
Quan Shengtang is my son.

10:16.600 --> 10:17.840
Your son?

10:18.760 --> 10:22.280
Things between Quan Shengtang and me
have nothing to do with you.

10:22.360 --> 10:24.040
You still haven't answered me.

10:24.120 --> 10:26.040
Why did you lie about pursuing me?

10:32.400 --> 10:33.720
What if it wasn't a lie?

10:46.480 --> 10:47.800
I enjoy being single.

10:48.440 --> 10:50.080
I have no plans to get married for now.

10:50.160 --> 10:53.360
If my actions have caused
any misunderstanding,

10:53.440 --> 10:54.440
I sincerely apologize.

10:54.520 --> 10:56.960
From today on,
let's not see each other again.

11:14.400 --> 11:16.760
Don't be so tense. It's kind of scary.

11:17.840 --> 11:19.680
I was just joking with you.

11:21.760 --> 11:24.880
Today, I was simply trying to help.

11:31.040 --> 11:32.800
If you keep acting like this,
I'll get mad.

11:32.880 --> 11:34.720
We're all friends.

11:34.800 --> 11:36.360
Quan Shengtang can back you up.

11:36.440 --> 11:37.560
Why can't I?

11:38.320 --> 11:39.320
Since we're being honest,

11:40.080 --> 11:41.640
I might as well admit it.

11:42.920 --> 11:44.240
Actually, I'm also afraid

11:46.320 --> 11:47.600
of being tied down by marriage.

11:50.680 --> 11:54.080
I don't have much confidence in love.

11:54.160 --> 11:56.520
It's easy to start a relationship,
and even easier to break up.

11:56.600 --> 11:57.960
I have many ex-girlfriends.

11:58.680 --> 11:59.840
Do I look like the kind of man

12:00.440 --> 12:02.120
who fixates

12:02.200 --> 12:03.080
on one woman

12:03.160 --> 12:04.920
and stays bound for life?

12:06.440 --> 12:09.320
Not really.

12:15.920 --> 12:17.480
Should I invite all my ex-girlfriends

12:17.560 --> 12:19.080
for a meal together?

12:19.160 --> 12:21.240
No need, no need.

12:21.840 --> 12:24.200
You acted so convincingly. I got scared.

12:24.880 --> 12:25.720
Really?

12:33.360 --> 12:35.600
Do you really have a lot of exes?

12:39.280 --> 12:40.480
I do.

12:41.720 --> 12:43.160
Could they all sit at one table?

12:45.520 --> 12:46.360
Yes.

12:48.440 --> 12:49.720
Wouldn't they start fighting?

12:50.840 --> 12:52.160
We parted on good terms.

12:53.280 --> 12:55.680
We couldn't be lovers,
but we can still be friends.

12:56.240 --> 12:57.360
After all, in this world,

12:57.440 --> 12:59.960
having one more friend is better
than having one more enemy.

13:46.440 --> 13:48.400
With your eye condition,
how can you drink?

13:54.400 --> 13:56.520
The doctor said
it's a psychological issue,

13:56.600 --> 13:57.720
not a physical one.

14:08.520 --> 14:09.400
You're in a bad mood.

14:11.960 --> 14:13.200
What happened?

14:15.240 --> 14:16.360
Is it about Lin Yuan?

14:19.000 --> 14:21.400
I always thought I was a rational lover.

14:21.480 --> 14:22.840
Now, I realize

14:24.720 --> 14:26.280
I might be an emotional lover.

14:30.920 --> 14:32.120
Lin Yuan doesn't like you,

14:33.600 --> 14:34.640
but you won't give up.

14:38.400 --> 14:41.120
Can't you use a little
of your intelligence on yourself?

14:42.560 --> 14:43.480
I did.

14:44.120 --> 14:45.360
More than just a little.

14:46.440 --> 14:48.040
But I still don't get it.

14:50.520 --> 14:52.640
Tell me. What happened?

14:54.920 --> 14:56.520
The Quan Shengtang in my eyes has colors.

14:59.200 --> 15:00.480
Quan Shengtang?

15:01.640 --> 15:02.480
What about Lin Yuan?

15:04.200 --> 15:05.440
Lin Yuan had no color.

15:08.240 --> 15:09.320
That doesn't make sense.

15:09.880 --> 15:12.040
Lin Yuan is Su Chengcheng's best friend.

15:13.080 --> 15:14.520
I went to see Su Qingli.

15:15.640 --> 15:17.360
Su Qingli had no color either.

15:18.320 --> 15:20.160
Could it be random?

15:20.880 --> 15:23.000
If it's random,

15:23.080 --> 15:25.440
maybe Su Chengcheng
isn't in color anymore.

15:28.240 --> 15:30.360
Bring Quan Shengtang
and Su Chengcheng together.

15:30.440 --> 15:32.600
You'll know it once you meet them.

15:34.920 --> 15:36.680
I've thought about that.

15:40.200 --> 15:42.360
But Quan Shengtang was in a rush
to see Fang Jin.

15:45.720 --> 15:47.240
He even told Fang Jin,

15:50.200 --> 15:51.280
"I miss you too."

16:08.280 --> 16:09.520
I also want

16:12.280 --> 16:13.440
to say that to her,

16:20.920 --> 16:22.360
but she can't hear me anymore.

16:46.440 --> 16:49.600
MISSED CALL: TANG QI

17:00.880 --> 17:03.520
Why did Tang Qi invite me
and Quan Shengtang

17:03.600 --> 17:04.920
for coffee?

17:06.760 --> 17:08.960
I thought he had discovered something,

17:09.720 --> 17:11.200
but clearly, that's not the case.

17:14.160 --> 17:16.720
Do you think I should call Tang Qi

17:16.800 --> 17:17.960
and ask him about it?

17:21.960 --> 17:22.800
Ask about what?

17:24.400 --> 17:25.640
Nothing.

17:25.720 --> 17:27.440
I'll just ask Tang Qi directly.

17:45.240 --> 17:47.440
SU CHENGCHENG

17:54.920 --> 17:56.360
Mr. Tang, hello.

17:56.440 --> 17:57.440
Sorry.

17:57.520 --> 18:00.000
I didn't hear my phone earlier
and missed your call.

18:00.080 --> 18:01.240
This is Gu Yu.

18:02.000 --> 18:03.360
Mr. Gu.

18:03.440 --> 18:04.640
Hello, hello.

18:05.720 --> 18:07.200
Tang Qi is drunk.

18:07.280 --> 18:08.480
He can't answer the phone.

18:09.720 --> 18:10.880
Drunk?

18:14.040 --> 18:16.960
Is it because of Fang Jin?

18:23.440 --> 18:24.400
What did you need him for?

18:24.480 --> 18:25.640
I can pass on the message.

18:27.720 --> 18:30.400
Quan Shengtang said Mr. Tang
invited us for coffee.

18:30.480 --> 18:33.200
I wanted to ask him what it was about.

18:35.320 --> 18:36.560
Are you coming to work tomorrow?

18:36.640 --> 18:37.800
Yes.

18:38.520 --> 18:40.200
Then you can ask him at the office.

18:43.480 --> 18:45.000
Is Mr. Tang okay?

18:53.960 --> 18:55.560
What could happen to an adult?

18:56.160 --> 18:57.400
A good night's sleep will fix it.

18:57.960 --> 18:59.720
OK, Mr. Gu, goodbye.

19:01.600 --> 19:02.880
Gu Yu?

19:07.080 --> 19:08.080
Lin Yuan.

19:09.000 --> 19:10.960
The more I think about it,
the more embarrassed I feel.

19:11.040 --> 19:12.520
You helped me today,

19:12.600 --> 19:14.440
but I was suspicious of you.

19:14.520 --> 19:15.520
Are you mad at me?

19:20.280 --> 19:21.200
No.

19:21.280 --> 19:22.760
Are we still friends?

19:22.840 --> 19:24.080
Good friends.

19:32.120 --> 19:32.960
What's up?

19:36.080 --> 19:37.240
I think…

19:38.520 --> 19:40.080
Gu Yu likes you.

19:44.400 --> 19:45.760
I think…

19:45.840 --> 19:47.640
Tang Qi likes you.

19:52.280 --> 19:54.400
Tang Qi is a rational lover.

19:55.000 --> 19:56.440
The people he likes

19:56.520 --> 20:00.520
are either as stunning as Su Miao

20:00.600 --> 20:03.000
or as accomplished as Fang Jin,

20:03.080 --> 20:04.760
a PhD from a prestigious university,

20:04.840 --> 20:06.240
running her own company.

20:06.880 --> 20:09.360
All of them have the external qualities
that match him.

20:09.960 --> 20:12.440
Look at me. What do I have?

20:12.520 --> 20:16.800
Am I stunning? Am I a genius?

20:18.040 --> 20:19.640
Gu Yu doesn't want to get married either.

20:19.720 --> 20:22.240
Like me, he doesn't believe in marriage.

20:22.320 --> 20:24.320
Besides, look at me here.

20:24.920 --> 20:26.400
Do you see any love here?

20:38.440 --> 20:40.080
To align with the e-commerce platform's

20:40.160 --> 20:42.000
"Millennia of Beauty"
promotional campaign,

20:42.080 --> 20:44.680
we've decided to launch
a limited-edition gift box.

20:45.680 --> 20:46.640
Compared to previous promotions,

20:46.720 --> 20:49.320
this event focuses more
on conceptualization.

20:49.400 --> 20:51.600
Through a series of activities,

20:51.680 --> 20:53.800
we hope to enhance
the overall appeal of our products

20:53.880 --> 20:56.360
and build a high-end domestic brand image.

20:56.960 --> 20:59.440
Chinese beauty culture has been documented

20:59.520 --> 21:01.000
for over 3,000 years.

21:01.600 --> 21:03.640
Back then, both men and women

21:03.720 --> 21:06.280
would enhance their looks
for the ones they loved,

21:06.360 --> 21:09.040
giving beauty an added layer of romance.

21:09.120 --> 21:12.400
Love is also a topic
young people today care about.

21:13.080 --> 21:14.000
I think we can

21:14.080 --> 21:15.600
design the campaign from the perspective

21:15.680 --> 21:17.480
of young people's interests.

21:17.560 --> 21:19.240
Are young people the only ones with love?

21:19.320 --> 21:20.720
What about middle-aged and elderly people?

21:22.000 --> 21:23.160
There's no rule saying

21:23.240 --> 21:25.440
only those under 35 can pursue beauty.

21:26.120 --> 21:28.640
Once you hit 40,
are you banned from wearing makeup?

21:29.320 --> 21:30.720
At TBC, we never said

21:30.800 --> 21:32.760
our products are only for the young.

21:33.720 --> 21:35.840
Traditional culture is for all ages.

21:35.920 --> 21:38.160
We shouldn't limit ourselves
to just young people's preferences.

21:40.920 --> 21:42.120
Let's keep it as before.

21:42.200 --> 21:44.480
Everyone, please brainstorm,

21:44.560 --> 21:45.400
form teams as you like,

21:45.480 --> 21:46.840
and submit your proposals.

21:46.920 --> 21:48.600
We'll use the best one.

21:53.360 --> 21:54.840
- Hi, Mr. Tang.
- Mr. Tang.

21:54.920 --> 21:55.800
Hi.

21:59.400 --> 22:00.640
- Hi, Mr. Tang.
- Mr. Tang.

22:01.800 --> 22:03.040
Hi, Mr. Tang.

22:29.560 --> 22:30.440
Mr. Tang.

23:01.000 --> 23:02.360
Are you performing a silent play?

23:03.520 --> 23:05.800
Mr. Tang,
why did you call me this weekend?

23:09.680 --> 23:10.680
I had something to ask you.

23:10.760 --> 23:12.320
What was it?

23:14.800 --> 23:15.960
I've already got my answer.

23:16.720 --> 23:17.560
It's fine now.

23:19.680 --> 23:21.320
Then I'll get back to work.

23:21.400 --> 23:22.360
Goodbye, Mr. Tang.

23:22.440 --> 23:23.320
Goodbye, Mr. Gu.

23:30.680 --> 23:34.000
Looks like Su Chengcheng
is still in color.

23:36.520 --> 23:38.920
But why Su Chengcheng and Quan Shengtang?

23:40.160 --> 23:42.520
The doctor said my subconscious
was trying to tell me something.

23:44.600 --> 23:46.280
But no matter how I analyze it,

23:47.240 --> 23:49.480
I just can't figure out
what it's trying to say.

23:50.000 --> 23:52.880
No matter what, you have two keys now.

23:52.960 --> 23:54.480
Su Chengcheng and Quan Shengtang.

23:55.800 --> 23:57.160
Following Doctor Chen's advice,

23:57.240 --> 23:59.520
you need to interact with them more
to solve this issue.

24:05.920 --> 24:07.760
I want to talk to Su Chengcheng in person,

24:09.320 --> 24:10.480
tell her the truth,

24:11.640 --> 24:12.600
and ask for her help.

24:14.080 --> 24:16.000
No way. Absolutely not.

24:16.080 --> 24:17.240
I'm negotiating an investment.

24:17.320 --> 24:18.840
You are the company's core asset.

24:18.920 --> 24:20.680
Your eye condition must be kept secret.

24:20.760 --> 24:23.160
If this gets out, it'll hurt the company.

24:51.120 --> 24:52.120
How about this?

24:53.280 --> 24:54.560
Look here carefully.

24:54.640 --> 24:56.560
This is shade 21, and this is shade 98.

24:56.640 --> 24:57.640
The difference is huge.

24:57.720 --> 24:59.280
You really can't tell?

25:01.880 --> 25:03.000
No.

25:08.520 --> 25:11.360
Can you tell
which lipstick shade I'm wearing?

25:18.360 --> 25:19.240
No.

25:26.680 --> 25:29.920
It's okay. Don't worry.

25:30.000 --> 25:31.600
Don't panic. Don't be scared.

25:32.400 --> 25:33.680
Let me think.

25:34.280 --> 25:35.120
Let me think.

25:45.200 --> 25:47.720
I'm a grown man.
I'm not going to cry over this.

25:48.520 --> 25:50.160
I wasn't asking you to wipe your tears.

25:50.240 --> 25:51.360
You should wipe off the lipstick.

25:58.120 --> 26:00.920
It's a psychological issue?

26:02.000 --> 26:04.520
And Su Chengcheng is the key to the cure?

26:09.160 --> 26:10.160
Could this illness

26:10.240 --> 26:13.000
be because you love Su Chengcheng
but can't have her?

26:19.960 --> 26:21.120
Come on.

26:21.200 --> 26:23.720
Didn't you pursue her for a while,
sending her flowers every week?

26:27.120 --> 26:29.480
I heard you even forced a hug on her.

26:39.800 --> 26:42.520
I was just stating the facts.

26:43.960 --> 26:45.920
Besides Su Chengcheng,
there's another man.

26:46.000 --> 26:48.320
Tang can see his colors too.

26:50.640 --> 26:52.480
Then my analysis was wrong.

26:52.560 --> 26:54.440
Right. Su Chengcheng isn't a doctor.

26:54.520 --> 26:56.840
How could she possibly fix this?
Here's what we'll do.

26:57.440 --> 27:00.320
I'll contact a friend
and find the best psychologist in China.

27:00.400 --> 27:01.800
This can't be delayed.

27:01.880 --> 27:02.720
Zhou.

27:05.680 --> 27:06.640
What?

27:08.480 --> 27:09.760
Your lipstick isn't fully wiped off.

27:10.480 --> 27:12.480
Don't fixate on trifles like this. You…

27:15.160 --> 27:17.080
It's fine, it's fine.

27:17.160 --> 27:18.520
Don't worry.

27:18.600 --> 27:21.440
You two, don't panic. Don't be afraid.

27:21.520 --> 27:23.760
I'm here for you.

27:31.560 --> 27:32.400
Sorry.

27:33.680 --> 27:34.960
Because of my eyes,

27:36.480 --> 27:38.200
I've caused trouble for the company.

27:40.960 --> 27:42.240
Didn't Zhou just say it?

27:42.920 --> 27:44.320
It's fine.

27:44.400 --> 27:46.760
Don't worry. Don't panic. Don't be afraid.

27:46.840 --> 27:47.920
He's here.

27:54.920 --> 27:56.720
Su Chengcheng is in the company,

27:56.800 --> 27:58.880
which means the key is right here.

27:59.440 --> 28:01.480
We'll definitely find a solution.

28:11.320 --> 28:13.120
YOUNG?

28:27.920 --> 28:28.920
Thank you.

28:31.200 --> 28:33.240
How's it going? Still no ideas?

28:34.920 --> 28:36.840
This is so hard.

28:36.920 --> 28:40.080
We have to cater to both 20-year-olds
and 40-year-olds,

28:40.160 --> 28:41.840
blend the trendy with the traditional,

28:41.920 --> 28:43.920
and showcase heritage and innovation.

28:44.000 --> 28:45.880
I haven't found
how to make a breakthrough.

28:45.960 --> 28:47.280
What about you?

28:48.200 --> 28:49.600
I'm at a loss too.

28:54.920 --> 28:56.720
We already have a great idea.

28:57.960 --> 28:58.880
Congratulations.

28:59.600 --> 29:00.720
Wang Yi,

29:00.800 --> 29:02.320
you should've chosen my team.

29:16.080 --> 29:17.600
Let's just do our best.

29:17.680 --> 29:18.720
Alright.

29:20.480 --> 29:21.760
Time to get off work.

29:22.680 --> 29:24.840
- See you tomorrow.
- See you tomorrow.

29:30.160 --> 29:31.920
Chengcheng, let's head home too.

29:32.000 --> 29:34.320
Maybe relaxing a bit
will spark some inspiration.

29:35.840 --> 29:37.040
Alright.

29:41.400 --> 29:42.920
Thanks for the cookies.

29:55.480 --> 29:56.520
Lin Yuan?

30:01.120 --> 30:03.240
Mr. Tang. Mr. Gu.

30:05.360 --> 30:08.240
Gu Yu and I are heading
to your neighborhood for something.

30:08.320 --> 30:09.400
We can give you a ride.

30:11.760 --> 30:13.760
Do you need anything from me?

30:18.800 --> 30:19.960
Nothing.

30:24.240 --> 30:26.840
Thanks, but I like taking the subway.

30:26.920 --> 30:28.280
I'll go first. Bye.

30:28.360 --> 30:29.200
Goodbye, Mr. Gu.

30:49.360 --> 30:50.720
Is this your plan?

30:51.440 --> 30:54.040
My plan was for you, as a friendly boss,

30:54.120 --> 30:55.400
to happen to run
into an off-duty colleague

30:55.480 --> 30:58.120
and kindly offer a ride.

30:58.200 --> 30:59.560
A chance to interact more.

30:59.640 --> 31:00.880
Not for you to look stiff,

31:00.960 --> 31:03.080
like the Big Bad Wolf luring
Little Red Riding Hood.

31:06.200 --> 31:08.320
- Where are you going?
- To run into her on the subway.

31:13.600 --> 31:15.400
We could use a little luck.

31:45.320 --> 31:47.200
Mr. Tang, why are you taking the subway?

31:49.920 --> 31:52.080
Gu Yu's too busy to give me a ride.

31:52.160 --> 31:53.520
Then, why not drive yourself?

31:55.600 --> 31:56.720
I'm not feeling well.

31:58.440 --> 31:59.560
What's wrong?

32:01.320 --> 32:02.280
It's my privacy.

32:03.120 --> 32:04.320
I can't tell you.

32:07.680 --> 32:09.520
Is something wrong with Tang Qi's eyes?

32:16.720 --> 32:18.760
Mr. Tang, you're good at English.

32:18.840 --> 32:20.040
Can you help me read

32:20.120 --> 32:22.080
the word on the back of my phone case?

32:22.160 --> 32:23.360
What does it mean?

32:24.880 --> 32:26.680
You don't even know
what's on your phone case?

32:27.280 --> 32:29.680
I was a sports major. My academics suck.

32:35.320 --> 32:36.640
A single woman with high status.

32:38.000 --> 32:39.520
Thanks for the compliment.

32:42.920 --> 32:44.360
His vision seems fine.

32:44.440 --> 32:45.960
He can see colors too.

32:46.040 --> 32:47.760
So, what's wrong?

33:24.800 --> 33:25.640
Tang Qi.

33:26.760 --> 33:27.680
Tang Qi.

33:28.800 --> 33:29.760
Tang Qi.

33:45.200 --> 33:46.320
Even if it was unintentional,

33:46.400 --> 33:48.720
shouldn't you apologize as a gentleman?

34:09.760 --> 34:11.120
Let me go.

34:13.920 --> 34:16.880
I told you to let me go.

34:25.480 --> 34:26.679
Ow, ow, ow.

34:41.080 --> 34:42.239
I get it.

34:43.040 --> 34:44.600
I get it now.

34:44.679 --> 34:46.600
Just let go.

34:46.679 --> 34:47.719
Let go of me.

35:07.720 --> 35:10.000
Tang Qi doesn't have an eye problem.

35:10.680 --> 35:12.680
It's his brain.

35:38.920 --> 35:39.920
Sorry.

35:52.280 --> 35:53.160
Your hands.

36:08.720 --> 36:11.320
I grew up practicing Yongchun with my dad.

36:11.400 --> 36:13.800
Next time you want to do an experiment,
give me a heads-up.

36:15.680 --> 36:16.600
Sorry.

36:31.400 --> 36:34.400
What kind of experiment
requires hand-holding?

36:39.040 --> 36:39.880
Sorry.

36:44.240 --> 36:45.400
If you weren't Tang Qi,

36:45.480 --> 36:46.760
I'd think you were talking nonsense

36:46.840 --> 36:48.360
and had inappropriate thoughts about me.

36:50.320 --> 36:51.160
Come on.

36:51.840 --> 36:54.280
I'm not underestimating myself,
thinking you're out of my league.

36:57.840 --> 36:59.440
What I mean is,

36:59.520 --> 37:03.800
you'd need to grow a lot more courage

37:03.880 --> 37:07.960
and train in Iron Shirt
and Golden Bell Cover.

37:19.680 --> 37:21.040
Are you cold?

37:24.080 --> 37:24.920
I…

37:32.200 --> 37:34.000
Have something warm. Here.

37:35.120 --> 37:36.520
Forget it. It's inconvenient for you.

37:36.600 --> 37:37.640
I'll hold it.

37:39.480 --> 37:41.200
- I'm not cold.
- You're not cold?

37:41.280 --> 37:42.520
You were shivering just now.

37:42.600 --> 37:44.400
Stop saving face
and making yourself suffer.

37:44.480 --> 37:45.520
I…

37:54.000 --> 37:54.840
Drink more.

38:34.720 --> 38:35.800
What's wrong?

38:41.000 --> 38:42.000
Nothing.

38:48.920 --> 38:50.240
For a second,

38:53.080 --> 38:54.520
I thought Fang Jin was back.

38:56.920 --> 39:00.120
Didn't Gu Yu say sleeping would fix it?

39:00.200 --> 39:02.480
Why is Tang Qi still missing her?
